#
# Production (Low Traffic):
# - Supabase Pro: $25/month (8GB database, 50GB bandwidth)
# - Clerk Pro: $25/month (10,000 MAU + premium features)
# - Zoom: Free (Basic plan sufficient)
# - AssemblyAI: Pay-as-you-go (~$15-75/month for 100-500 hours)
# - Gmail API: Free (with rate limits)
# - OpenAI: Pay-as-you-go (~$50-200/month depending on usage)
# - Vercel Pro: $20/month (enhanced performance + analytics)
#
# Total Estimated Cost: $135-345/month for production deployment

